# 2. Vending Machine — C#

This is a classic **State Pattern** problem.

### Requirements

- Select product
- Insert money
- Validate balance
- Dispense product
- Return change
- Cancel transaction
- Handle out-of-stock
- Handle insufficient money

---

## State Machine

```
             Insert Money
IDLE ----------------------> HAS_MONEY
                               |
                               | Select Product
                               ↓
                         PRODUCT_SELECTED
                               |
                               | Enough Money
                               ↓
                            DISPENSE
                               |
                               ↓
                              IDLE
```

Cancellation can happen from states where money has been inserted.

---

## Main Classes

```
VendingMachine
      |
      +---- Inventory
      |
      +---- Payment
      |
      +---- VendingMachineState
                 |
                 +-- IdleState
                 +-- HasMoneyState
                 +-- ProductSelectedState
                 +-- DispensingState
```

---

## Product

