# 3. Parking Lot — C#

This is primarily an **object modeling + Strategy Pattern** problem.

### Requirements

- Multiple floors
- Multiple spot types
- Different vehicle types
- Entry/exit
- Ticket generation
- Parking spot allocation
- Pricing

---

## Basic Model

```
ParkingLot
   |
   +---- ParkingFloor
             |
             +---- ParkingSpot
                      |
                      +-- CompactSpot
                      +-- LargeSpot
                      +-- MotorcycleSpot

Vehicle
   |
   +-- Car
   +-- Truck
   +-- Motorcycle
```

---

## Vehicle

```csharp
public enum VehicleType
{
    Motorcycle,
    Car,
    Truck
}

public abstract class Vehicle
