And for the four problems:

```
LRU
→ Dictionary + Doubly Linked List
→ O(1) Get/Put

Vending Machine
→ State Pattern
→ Idle → Money → Selection → Dispense

Parking Lot
→ Vehicle + Spot + Floor + Ticket
→ Spot Allocation Strategy
→ Pricing Strategy

Elevator
→ Elevator + Request + Controller
