For an **SDE-2 interview**, I'd also be prepared for the interviewer to take the basic design and ask: **"Now make it thread-safe", "support multiple entry gates", "support EV charging", "change pricing without code changes", or "what happens when two requests arrive simultaneously?"** Those follow-ups are often more important than the initial class diagram.